   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">I already asked this on stackoverflow but I nobody was answering. So, I&#39;m trying my luck here...<div><br></div><div><div>I&#39;m trying to add an image to my Shiny application (set up with shiny dashboard) that resides in a box and automatically resizes with the box.</div><div><br></div><div>I thought this could be done with some HTML/CSS tricks and found <a href=\"http://stackoverflow.com/questions/9994493/scale-image-to-fit-a-bounding-box/\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://stackoverflow.com/questions/9994493/scale-image-to-fit-a-bounding-box/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792392735393000&amp;usg=AOvVaw26A9IU0fM8r5Wfa2UZzP8w\">Scale image to fit a bounding box</a>. Thus, I created a custom.css in a www folder in my app and added the following CSS</div><div><br></div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">someimage </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">{</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>  background</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">image</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">:</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> url</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&#39;someimage.png&#39;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">);</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>  background</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">repeat</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">:</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,136)\">no</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">repeat</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>  background</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">size</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">:</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> contain</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">}</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">main</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">header </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">logo </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">{</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>  font</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">family</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">:</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&quot;Georgia&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,0,102)\">Times</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&quot;Times New Roman&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> serif</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">}</span></code></div><div><br></div><div>with someimage.png residing in the same place. The application looks like</div><div><br></div><div>ui.R</div><div><br></div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><span style=\"color:rgb(136,0,0)\"># UI</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>library</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">shiny</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>library</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">shinydashboard</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>dashboardPage</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>  dashboardHeader</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">title </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&quot;Title&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">),</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> <br>  dashboardSidebar</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(),</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> <br>  dashboardBody</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>    tags$head</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>      tags$link</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">rel </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&quot;stylesheet&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> type </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&quot;text/css&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> href </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&quot;custom.css&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">),</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>    box</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">title </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&quot;Some image&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>        tags$div</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,136)\">class</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&#39;someimage&#39;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">))</span></code></div><div><br></div><div>server.R</div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><span style=\"color:rgb(136,0,0)\"># Server</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>shinyServer</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,136)\">function</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">input</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> output</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">{})</span></code></div><br></div><div>As a test I also altered the header font, which does get changed into serif. Furthermore, when I open the developer tools in Chrome and look for it I find the correct div and css class.</div><div><br></div><div>I also found <a href=\"http://stackoverflow.com/questions/21996887/embedding-image-in-shiny-app\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://stackoverflow.com/questions/21996887/embedding-image-in-shiny-app&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792392735393000&amp;usg=AOvVaw239KkkTLPo3pYHSPwlLM2x\">Embedding Image in Shiny App</a> but it didn&#39;t really help.</div></div><div><br></div><div>Would be very happy if someone could help.</div><div><br></div><div>Thanks in advance,</div><div><br></div><div>Cheers,</div><div>Pascal</div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "_qBkO-X2AQAJ",
   "from": "Dario Strbenac",
