   "subject": "Re: Image via CSS",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">If it is a PNG image, do you <i>really </i>want it to scale with the size of the page ? It&#39;s a raster image format, not a vector format, so it would look blurry after scaling is applied to it.<br></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
