     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><br><br>On Tuesday, July 19, 2016 at 3:03:06 AM UTC+2, Joe Cheng [RStudio] wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\">I&#39;m guessing the div.someimage size is 0x0? Can you use chrome dev tools to check the computed size?<br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"ltr\">On Mon, Jul 18, 2016 at 6:00 PM Dario Strbenac &lt;<a rel=\"nofollow\">dario....@gmail.com</a>&gt; wrote:<br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">If it is a PNG image, do you <i>really </i>want it to scale with the size of the page ? It&#39;s a raster image format, not a vector format, so it would look blurry after scaling is applied to it.<br></div>\r\n\r\n<p></p>\r\n\r\n-- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;Shiny - Web Framework for R&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to <a rel=\"nofollow\">shiny-discus...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nTo view this discussion on the web visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/shiny-discuss/af7c6481-1c08-4a83-9c05-ebf0f43983bc%40googlegroups.com?utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=footer\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/shiny-discuss/af7c6481-1c08-4a83-9c05-ebf0f43983bc%2540googlegroups.com?utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_source%3Dfooter&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792392735395000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1LdkApxWiSnhx_sAr8qXSC\">https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/shiny-discuss/af7c6481-1c08-4a83-9c05-ebf0f43983bc%40googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nFor more options, visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/optout\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/optout&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792392735395000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1sXpVt-luekJaboufBjtfK\">https://groups.google.com/d/optout</a>.<br>\r\n</blockquote></div>\r\n</blockquote></div>"
