t=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://stackoverflow.com/questions/21996887/embedding-image-in-shiny-app&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792392735398000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3agw5XFxuNKZO6fgdtH-sm\">Embedding Image in Shiny App</a> but it didn&#39;t really help.</div></div><div><br></div><div>Would be very happy if someone could help.</div><div><br></div><div>Thanks in advance,</div><div><br></div><div>Cheers,</div><div>Pascal</div></div></blockquote></div></div>"
