     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><br><br>On Thursday, July 21, 2016 at 9:52:07 AM UTC+2, Joe Cheng [RStudio] wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\">The 0 height makes sense if it&#39;s empty. What were you thinking would determine the height of the div?<br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"ltr\">On Thu, Jul 21, 2016 at 12:43 AM Pascal &lt;<a rel=\"nofollow\">hellopasca...@gmail.com</a>&gt; wrote:<br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">So, I just found a way that works:<div><br></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(36,39,41);font-family:Arial,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,sans-serif;line-height:16.9px\"><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">HTML</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;&lt;img src=&#39;source-path&#39; class=&#39;img-responsive&#39; /&gt;&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div></code></div><br></span>also, I converted the image to svg.</div></div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br><br>On Monday, July 18, 2016 at 3:05:30 PM UTC+2, Pascal wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">I already asked this on stackoverflow but I nobody was answering. So, I&#39;m trying my luck here...<div><br></div><div><div>I&#39;m trying to add an image to my Shiny application (set up with shiny dashboard) that resides in a box and automatically resizes with the box.</div><div><br></div><div>I thought this could be done with some HTML/CSS tricks and found <a href=\"http://stackoverflow.com/questions/9994493/scale-image-to-fit-a-bounding-box/\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://stackoverflow.com/questions/9994493/scale-image-to-fit-a-bounding-box/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792392735406000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1-ARp5pVEb6b2HuF9FMeaT\">Scale image to fit a bounding box</a>. Thus, I created a custom.css in a www folder in my app and added the following CSS</div><div><br></div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">someimage </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">{</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>  background</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">image</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">:</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> url</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&#39;someimage.png&#39;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">);</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>  background</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">repeat</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">:</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,136)\">no</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">repeat</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>  background</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">size</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">:</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> contain</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">}</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">main</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">header </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">logo </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">{</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>  font</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">family</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">:</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&quot;Georgia&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,0,102)\">Times</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&quot;Times New Roman&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> serif</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">}</span></code></div><div><br></div><div>with someimage.png residing in the same place. The application looks like</div><div><br></div><div>ui.R</div><div><br></div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><span style=\"color:rgb(136,0,0)\"># UI</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>library</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">shiny</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>library</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">shinydashboard</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>dashboardPage</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>  dashboardHeader</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">title </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&quot;Title&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">),</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> <br>  dashboardSidebar</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(),</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> <br>  dashboardBody</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>    tags$head</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>      tags$link</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">rel </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&quot;stylesheet&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> type </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&quot;text/css&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> href </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&quot;custom.css&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">),</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>    box</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">title </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&quot;Some image&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>        tags$div</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,136)\">class</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&#39;someimage&#39;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">))</span></code></div><div><br></div><div>server.R</div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><span style=\"color:rgb(136,0,0)\"># Server</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>shinyServer</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,136)\">function</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">input</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> output</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">{})</span></code></div><br></div><div>As a test I also altered the header font, which does get changed into serif. Furthermore, when I open the developer tools in Chrome and look for it I find the correct div and css class.</div><div><br></div><div>I also found <a href=\"http://stackoverflow.com/questions/21996887/embedding-image-in-shiny-app\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://stackoverflow.com/questions/21996887/embedding-image-in-shiny-app&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792392735406000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2rC5y6CkZ_x3OfVUC8O2yL\">Embedding Image in Shiny App</a> but it didn&#39;t really help.</div></div><div><br></div><div>Would be very happy if someone could help.</div><div><br></div><div>Thanks in advance,</div><div><br></div><div>Cheers,</div><div>Pascal</div></div></blockquote></div></div>\r\n\r\n<p></p>\r\n\r\n-- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;Shiny - Web Framework for R&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to <a rel=\"nofollow\">shiny-discus...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nTo view this discussion on the web visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/shiny-discuss/1600b50f-1179-4e96-bd4a-51b65aa7ba1b%40googlegroups.com?utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=footer\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/shiny-discuss/1600b50f-1179-4e96-bd4a-51b65aa7ba1b%2540googlegroups.com?utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_source%3Dfooter&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792392735406000&amp;usg=AOvVaw17Hbjrpx5bgrI64fQ3CtJD\">https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/shiny-discuss/1600b50f-1179-4e96-bd4a-51b65aa7ba1b%40googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nFor more options, visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/optout\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/optout&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792392735406000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1ayCU_KeCvyokWKvsVub-Y\">https://groups.google.com/d/optout</a>.<br>\r\n</blockquote></div>\r\n</blockquote></div>"
